# MODAL-04 — Close on Escape and backdrop click

## Rationale

Escape-to-close is expected; native `<dialog>` provides Escape for free.

## How to check

Verify an Escape handler (or `<dialog>`) and backdrop dismissal exist.

## How to fix

Propose the handlers, or migrate to `<dialog>` for Escape.
